      {
        "id": 263965,
        "name": "",
        "username": "LonelyMan",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/l/f4b2a3/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2025-10-07T13:34:44.404Z",
        "cooked": "<p>On the Harpy shipping question, I’d like to think that while Lilian was in prison, some villainess took up a protectorship of the newly incarcerated and young and vulnerable Matriarch, and later on they ended up having to fight but were hesitant to hurt each other.  I have a hard time finding candidates to name, since while there’s close to gender parity between male and female main villains, the “mooks” villains are predominantly masculine, and a lot of the exceptions I can think of wouldn’t really work (Highbrow, Calypso, Ammut, two of the Crackjaw Crew, various Citizens).</p>\n<p>Things that they didn’t include in the MultiVerse which they were excited about…I can’t believe they didn’t mention Fashion, who we still don’t have even in Disparation.</p>\n<p>“Shame Boy” lol.  Shots fired!</p>",
